data: {"id": "a5e2d4f616e04996-thinking-layer-859", "run_id": "a5e2d4f616e04996", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据事件日志，Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间下，主要报错为：\n1. `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n2. `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition`\n\n这表明 Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态是因为卷挂载失败，具体原因是引用的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 不存在。\n\n**结论：**\n*   **异常 Pod**: `workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` (namespace: `aiops-case-03`)\n*   **状态**: `ContainerCreating`\n*   **异常类型**: `VolumeMountFaile", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 7, "ts_ms": 1788772886415}

