data: {"id": "a5e2d4f616e04996-thinking-layer-1438", "run_id": "a5e2d4f616e04996", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已获取到 `pod-volume-mount-failed.md` Runbook，并根据 Events 确认了根因是 ConfigMap 缺失。\n\n**分析总结：**\n*   **异常 Pod**: `workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` (namespace: `aiops-case-03`)\n*   **状态**: `ContainerCreating`\n*   **Events**: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n*   **Abnormal Type**: `VolumeMountFailed` (由 `ConfigMap` 缺失触发)\n*   **Key Entity**: ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n其他 Pod 状态均正常。\n\n现在我将生成最终的 `LayerOutput`。\n\nHEALTHY / ABNORMAL:", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 8, "ts_ms": 1788772894828}

