data: {"id": "a5e2d4f616e04996-thinking-parallel_evidence-1561", "run_id": "a5e2d4f616e04996", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已收到上游的 pre-react baseline 结果。根据结果，**Metrics 已确认** Pod 处于 Pending 且 Waiting reason 为 ContainerCreating，**Logging 和 Tracing 为空**（这是 ContainerCreating 阶段的预期结果，因为容器未启动，没有应用日志和流量）。\n\n现在需要执行 Kubernetes 核心诊断：**`kubectl_describe`** 获取事件（Events）和 **`kubectl_get_yaml`** 获取 Pod Spec，以区分是 Volume 挂载失败、镜像拉取失败还是 Sandbox 创建失败。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788772920811, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

