data: {"id": "a5e2d4f616e04996-thinking-parallel_evidence-2214", "run_id": "a5e2d4f616e04996", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n1.  **Pod 生命周期状态 (Metrics & K8s)**：\n    *   Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 当前处于 **Pending** 阶段。\n    *   容器 `app` 处于 **Waiting** 状态，等待原因为 **ContainerCreating**。\n    *   重启次数为 0，表明容器从未成功启动。\n\n2.  **根因事件 (K8s Events)**：\n    *   `kubectl describe` 明确返回了持续 73 分钟的阻塞事件：\n        *   `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (发生 40 次)。\n    *   伴随事件：`Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out w", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788772931334, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

