data: {"id": "a5e2d4f616e04996-final", "run_id": "a5e2d4f616e04996", "seq": 2219, "ts_ms": 1788772944284, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod声明了依赖ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'但未在namespace 'aiops-case-03'中创建（configmap not found）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-3ab1d86a6542) | 核心错误，说明挂载失败原因是配置缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod Phase: `Pending`, Container Waiting Reason: `ContainerCreating` (fact-12b3a9200ff0, fact-dacd5758cd6b) | 确认容器处于挂起等待状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount`: `timed out waiting for the condition` (fact-d7228dfdc5ec) | 证实 kubelet 在尝试挂载缺失资源时不断超时 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Volume name: `input` 映射依赖的 ConfigMap 名称：`unavailable-config` | 确认具体缺失的配置对象标识符 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` 值为 1 (fact-66adba875379) | 独立指标源确认了容器处于等待状态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\nK8s Event 提供了直接的业务错误（configmap not found），配合 K8s State 显示的 Pending 状态和 ContainerCreating 等待原因，确凿地指向资源依赖缺失导致启动阻塞。Metric 数据独立验证了容器处于等待状态的事实。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 声明依赖 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → 依赖对象在 Namespace 'aiops-case-03' 不存在 → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 'input' 失败并超时 → 容器进入 ContainerCreating 等待状态 (Pending)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 的 Volume `input` 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。该缺失的配置文件导致 Kubelet 无法完成挂载，进而使 Pod 陷入 `Pending` 状态且容器无法启动（引用证据 #1, #2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 35.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 34.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 34.1s (Evidence 29.2s, RCA 4.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 77.642, "metrics": {"run_id": "a5e2d4f616e04996", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 77.64319682121277, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 77643.19682121277, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 73165.70591926575, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 10020.565032958984, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4087.0442390441895}, "nodes": {"layer": {"